T1  - Real-world use and evaluation of a generative AI chatbot for Parkinson's disease information: a prospective observational study
AU  - Lange, Florian
AU  - Mardi, Ssaman
AU  - Binder, Tobias
AU  - Reich, Martin M.
AU  - Odorfer, Thorsten
AU  - Volkmann, Jens
