AB  - As the agentic AI paradigm continues to evolve, we can expect several game-changing shifts in the AI space in the days to come. AI agents, individually or collectively, can gain sophisticated decision-making capabilities. AI agents will become capable of handling complex tasks and situations. The autonomy and reasoning power of AI agents can drastically affect human intervention. The concept of agentic AI is to percolate into multiple industry verticals to offer business transformation use cases. The agentic AI technology will be more people-centric by delivering personalized experiences to users. In short, AI agents will open up fresh possibilities and opportunities for individuals, innovators and institutions. With many powerful machines and deep and reinforcement learning algorithms, we have a growing array of versatile AI models (domain-specific and agnostic, purpose-specific and agnostic). In the recent past, with the unprecedented adoption of transformer architecture, the whole world has been bombarded with numerous language models (large language models (LLMs), small language models (SLMs), multimodal language models (MLMs), vision language models (VLMs), etc.). Other futuristic mechanisms include retrieval augmented generation (RAG) frameworks, vector databases, knowledge graphs, etc. The distinct power of the agentic AI originates with the combination of the above-mentioned technological advancements. In this chapter, we are to discuss how agentic AI is to be highly impactful and influential for the whole world. Finally, we will articulate how agentic AI is a game-changing method for meeting the next-generation requirements of the software engineering field.
